{
  "schema": "demon-attack.rig-family/v1",
  "name": "mission-medals",
  "notes": "Composable end-of-run mission medals (openspec/changes/mission-medals, plan/render-runs/mission-medals.md). A layer family: one fixed frame for every hull (render.frame), so each slot's id-pass cut of a hull's hero pick is a whole, aligned atlas cell and a medal is drawn by stacking cells (ribbon, base, accent, emblem). Hull base = the bare medal; one hull per mission id (lib/game/bonus/bonus_catalog.dart) = base + that mission's ribbon, accent and emblem sets; hull generic = the fallback for unknown ids. A new mission adds one set to ribbon / emblem (and optionally accent), one hull, and its pick. Units are finished texels (1 unit = 1 cell px at texel 1.0). Frame: x right, y up (screen up), z toward the camera; the medal disc is centred at the origin, 12 px below the cell centre. Seen straight on (pitch 90).",
  "symmetric": false,
