    "notes": "Atlas cells in this hull order; a module cell comes from the first listed hull that has it (base from hull base). Cell id = slot, or slot.set. colours keep: the paint is area-averaged with its coverage (smooth edges, no palette, no ink), like the vector medals beside it; ink applies to the palette mode only.",
