  "prompts": {
    "hero": "Repaint this flat clay model as a finished, detailed painted game icon of a military service medal seen straight from the front: {subject}. A polished gold medal with a scalloped rim, a dark navy enamel centre{ribbon}. Keep every colour where the clay shows it: gold where the clay is gold, the coloured enamel ring and ribbon stripes exactly in the colours shown, the emblem in the colours shown. Bold clean shapes with crisp bevelled metal edges, glossy enamel, subtle silk sheen on the ribbon, lit from the upper left, readable at very small size, in the style of a polished sci-fi arcade game badge. Keep the outline, every shape, its size and its position exactly. Solid flat green background (#00FF00), no checkerboard, no shadow.",
    "subject_base": "a plain medal with an empty dark enamel centre and nothing on it",
    "subject_supplyRun": "the emblem is a mint-green parachute canopy carrying an amber supply crate",
    "subject_stormfront": "the emblem is a bold yellow lightning bolt",
    "subject_noShield": "the emblem is a sky-blue shield crossed out by a red diagonal bar",
    "subject_spreadOnly": "the emblem is three sky-blue shot trails fanning out from one mint muzzle, each ending in a white glowing round",
    "subject_heavyOrdnance": "the emblem is a heavy orange bomb with bright steel tail fins, nose down",
    "subject_generic": "the emblem is a silver five-pointed star",
    "negative": "text, letters, numbers, words, watermark, logo, signature, frame, border, blurry, photo, multiple views, grid, hand, person, background scene, checkerboard, shadow, perspective, tilted, extra emblems, laurel wreath, crown, ring, loop, folded ribbon, rust, dirt, scratches",
    "ribbon": " and a flat striped silk ribbon drape that tucks behind the medal, hung from a straight gold clasp bar at the top, exactly the shape shown (no ring, no loop, no fold)",
    "notes": "Prompt of hull H: hero with {subject} = subject_H and {ribbon} = ribbon (empty for hull base). Sampler denoise 0.72 (override $node:11.denoise) keeps the control framing so the id-pass cut fits.",
    "hero_v1": "Repaint this flat clay model as a finished, detailed painted game icon of a military service medal seen straight from the front: {subject}. A polished gold medal with a scalloped rim, a dark navy enamel centre{ribbon}. Keep every colour where the clay shows it: gold where the clay is gold, the coloured enamel ring and ribbon stripes exactly in the colours shown, the emblem in the colours shown. Bold clean shapes with crisp bevelled metal edges, glossy enamel, subtle silk sheen on the ribbon, lit from the upper left, readable at very small size, in the style of a polished sci-fi arcade game badge. Keep the outline, every shape and its position exactly. Solid flat green background (#00FF00), no checkerboard, no shadow.",
    "hero_v1_notes": "v1 (st-...-118, denoise 1.0): rejected, the edit re-framed the medal and redrew the ribbon as a short folded band on a ring, so the id-pass cut no longer fits."
